      "paragraphs": [
        "A bounded, externally fed Float32 PCM source at the shared AudioContext's sample rate. Lives in `@codexo/exojs-audio-fx`; no extension registration is required. Feed a bus or connect output to an analysis tap.",
        "Await ready, enqueue a caller-chosen amount of audio, then call start. The worklet consumes FIFO samples without waiting for the producer. An empty running queue emits silence; later blocks resume at the next available render quantum, without catching up or skipping samples. Browser suspension freezes the audio clock and playback, but writes remain bounded. Readiness does not unlock browser autoplay.",
        "Input arrays are copied synchronously and never detached. The private copy is transferred without requiring cross-origin isolation. Values must be finite; nominal full scale is -1..1, with no clipping or normalization here. Resampling, producer timestamps and audiovisual lookahead belong to callers.",
        "Own and destroy the source separately from its bus, for example with a scene DestroyScope. Destroying an AudioSystem or bus does not destroy this source."
      ],
      "importLine": "import { PcmStreamSource } from '@codexo/exojs-audio-fx'",
